# Version bump on push

Whenever the user asks to **push** (or commit+push) this repo:

1. Before committing (or as part of the push prep), bump the app version by **+010** on the build segment via `npm run version:bump` (e.g. `09.590` → `09.600`).
2. Include `src/lib/version.ts` in the commit that gets pushed.
3. Do **not** skip the bump unless the user explicitly says not to.

Display format stays `BETA V.MM.BBB` from `src/lib/version.ts`.
